ted seat on LA City  Council where Paul the  LA's mayor mayor and the two candidates  running to succeed him now say all three  council members should resign all of  them have apologized but none has shown  any sign of resigning despite mounting  pressure for them to do just that  Tony all right Mark's Mark Strassman for  us in Los Angeles which is unusual mark  thank you very much appreciate that  report
 

